Licence for data/ — two layers, deliberately separated
======================================================

The repository's root LICENSE is MIT and covers the CODE. It cannot and does not
cover everything under data/, because two different things live here.


1. THE ANNOTATIONS AND DERIVED TABLES — CC BY 4.0
-------------------------------------------------
Everything this project computed, decided or assembled:

  data/panel/*                    the credit graph, the panel, the source index
  data/derived/*                  every derived figure
  data/archive/* — the FIELDS     tier, lang, unit, theme, first_seen, date_is_capture,
                                  the credited-origin edges, the schema itself
  data/DICTIONARY.md

Licensed CC BY 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).
Attribute as: poisoned-well, github.com/abognar-git/poisoned-well.

The underlying article counts and credit labels are CheckFirst's
(github.com/CheckFirstHQ/pravda-network); attribute them too.


2. THE CAPTURED TEXT — NO RIGHTS ASSERTED, NONE GRANTED
-------------------------------------------------------
The `title` field of data/archive/* contains verbatim third-party text: headlines
from mirror sites and sanctioned outlets, and truncated excerpts of public Telegram
posts.

This project holds no rights in that text and grants none. It is reproduced here,
in truncated form and in limited quantity, to document and analyse an information
operation — reporting and academic research. Anyone reusing it is responsible for
their own basis for doing so.

Note for EU users: several of the outlets captured here are subject to EU
restrictive measures. Article 2f(3) of Council Regulation (EU) No 833/2014 provides
that the broadcasting prohibitions do not prevent the carrying out of research and
analysis activities in respect of that content. That provision is why this material
is here; it is not legal advice, and it does not extend to redistributing the
content for other purposes.

This is NOT released under CC0 or any permissive licence. A clean, labelled,
machine-readable corpus of this network's output under a permissive licence would be
more useful to the operation being studied than to anyone studying it.


3. WHAT IS DELIBERATELY ABSENT
------------------------------
  * No article body text is collected — headlines, and Telegram excerpts capped at
    120 characters.
  * Items reading as personal smears against named individuals are filtered out by a
    fixture-tested rule and are described in the case files rather than reproduced.
  * Propaganda domains appear as plain strings and are never hyperlinked anywhere in
    this repository.

Contact for takedown, correction or erasure requests: open an issue at
github.com/abognar-git/poisoned-well/issues.
